<center><table border=0 width="85%"><tr><td colspan=2>〔391〕 <font color=#008080>MagP Spawn time</font>　　<font size=-1 color=#000080>草の者：</font><font color=#ff6666>Suezoh@BoE(MAG)</font><font size=2 color=#000080> （Ｌｖ10）</font>　
